dynamic equation: M\ddot q + H + J_c^T \lambda= S^T\tau
with contact constraint: J_c\ddot{q} + \dot{J_c} \dot q = 0

subsitude \ddot q=M^{-1}(S^T\tau-H-J_c^T\lambda) into constraint formula:
\lambda = -D^{-1}(J_cM^{-1}h - \dot J_c \dot q) + D^{-1}J_cM^{-1}S^T \tau
in which D = J_c M^{-1}J_c^T

back-subsitude to dynamic equation:
\ddot q=d(q,\dot q)+B(q)\tau
in which P=M^{-1}-M^{-1}J_L^TD^{-1}J_LM^{-1}, B=PS^T, d=-PH-M^{-1}J_L^TD^{-1}\dot J_L \dot q
